<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of weekend</p>
<p>matches in the Argentine Apertura championship.</p>
<p> Banfield		   3    Boca Juniors		 1</p>
<p> Ferro Carril Oeste     1    Lanus			  2</p>
<p> Gimnasia-La Plata	1    Rosario Central	    2</p>
<p> Huracan		    1    Deportivo Espanol	  0</p>
<p> Huracan-Corrientes     2    Racing Club		  3</p>
<p> Independiente	    1    Gimnasia-Jujuy	     0</p>
<p> River Plate		4    San Lorenzo		  0</p>
<p> Union			0    Platense		     1</p>
<p> Velez Sarsfield	  0    Estudiantes		  2</p>
